		{
			dependencies: ["538B8A7C45672E07"]
			description: [
				"The moon-sand line is a good way to get passive moon ores such as: Ilmenite, Glunite, and Bastnasite. When you get into &9IV&r, the line is &ocompletely self-sustaining&r, and you no longer need to mine more moon sand from the actual moon. You can also get &bpassive electrotine&r in &9IV&r."
				""
				"To make it self sustaining, you will need to use &bspecialized helpers&r to &6output boost&r the recipes with moon sand as the output. This requires a &cchemical plant"
			]
			id: "0EEC4802432C5F8A"
			subtitle: "Worth your time if you hate mining on the moon"
